SCHEMA_YAML = 'openapi: 3.1.0\ninfo:\n  title: BORIS Agent Gateway\n  description: API BORIS для агента разработки. Job закрывается только с доказательством.\n  version: "1.0.0"\nservers:\n  - url: https://boris-ai.pro/api/v1\npaths:\n  /health/production:\n    get:\n      operationId: healthProduction\n      summary: Состояние базы, очереди задач и интеграций\n      responses: { "200": { description: OK } }\n  /capabilities:\n    get:\n      operationId: capabilities\n      summary: Какие операции реально доступны\n      responses: { "200": { description: OK } }\n  /agents:\n    get:\n      operationId: listAgents\n      summary: Реестр агентов и их доступность\n      responses: { "200": { description: OK } }\n  /agents/{agent_name}/heartbeat:\n    post:\n      operationId: agentHeartbeat\n      summary: Сообщить свою доступность\n      parameters:\n        - name: agent_name\n          in: path\n          required: true\n          schema: { type: string }\n      requestBody:\n        required: true\n        content:\n          application/json:\n            schema:\n              type: object\n              required: [status]\n              properties:\n                status: { type: string, enum: [available, limited, unavailable] }\n                note: { type: string }\n      responses: { "200": { description: OK } }\n  /dev/run:\n    post:\n      operationId: runDevelopmentTask\n      summary: Полный autonomous development lifecycle по задаче обычным языком\n      requestBody:\n        required: true\n        content:\n          application/json:\n            schema:\n              type: object\n              required: [task]\n              properties:\n                task: { type: string }\n                priority: { type: integer }\n                acceptance_criteria: { type: array, items: { type: string } }\n                scope_paths: { type: array, items: { type: string } }\n      responses: { "200": { description: OK } }\n  /dev/board:\n    get:\n      operationId: devBoard\n      summary: Доска задач разработки\n      responses: { "200": { description: OK } }\n  /dev/jobs:\n    get:\n      operationId: listDevJobs\n      summary: Список задач разработки\n      parameters:\n        - name: status\n          in: query\n          required: false\n          schema: { type: string }\n      responses: { "200": { description: OK } }\n    post:\n      operationId: createDevJob\n      summary: Завести задачу разработки с критериями приёмки\n      requestBody:\n        required: true\n        content:\n          application/json:\n            schema:\n              type: object\n              required: [title, goal, acceptance_criteria]\n              properties:\n                title: { type: string }\n                goal: { type: string }\n                acceptance_criteria: { type: array, items: { type: string } }\n                scope: { type: object }\n                priority: { type: integer }\n                locks: { type: array, items: { type: string } }\n      responses: { "201": { description: OK } }\n  /dev/jobs/{dev_job_id}:\n    get:\n      operationId: getDevJob\n      summary: Состояние задачи разработки\n      parameters:\n        - name: dev_job_id\n          in: path\n          required: true\n          schema: { type: string }\n      responses: { "200": { description: OK } }\n  /dev/jobs/{dev_job_id}/phase:\n    post:\n      operationId: updateDevPhase\n      summary: Отметить фазу; pass принимается только с evidence\n      parameters:\n        - name: dev_job_id\n          in: path\n          required: true\n          schema: { type: string }\n      requestBody:\n        required: true\n        content:\n          application/json:\n            schema:\n              type: object\n              required: [phase, state]\n              properties:\n                phase:\n                  type: string\n                  enum: [PLANNING, BACKEND, FRONTEND, UX, INTEGRATION, TESTING, FIXING, REGRESSION, ACCEPTANCE, DEPLOYMENT, PRODUCTION_QA]\n                state: { type: string, enum: [pending, running, pass, fail, skipped, blocked] }\n                evidence: { type: string }\n                files_changed: { type: array, items: { type: string } }\n                tests: { type: array, items: { type: object } }\n                errors: { type: array, items: { type: object } }\n                notes: { type: string }\n      responses: { "200": { description: OK } }\n  /dev/jobs/{dev_job_id}/criteria:\n    post:\n      operationId: markDevCriteria\n      summary: Закрыть критерий приёмки с доказательством\n      parameters:\n        - name: dev_job_id\n          in: path\n          required: true\n          schema: { type: string }\n      requestBody:\n        required: true\n        content:\n          application/json:\n            schema:\n              type: object\n              required: [index]\n              properties:\n                index: { type: integer }\n                done: { type: boolean }\n                evidence: { type: string }\n      responses: { "200": { description: OK } }\n  /dev/jobs/{dev_job_id}/ops:\n    post:\n      operationId: setDevOperation\n      summary: Статус дочерней операции TEXT IMAGES BANNERS FEED PUBLISH QA\n      parameters:\n        - name: dev_job_id\n          in: path\n          required: true\n          schema: { type: string }\n      requestBody:\n        required: true\n        content:\n          application/json:\n            schema:\n              type: object\n              required: [name, status]\n              properties:\n                name: { type: string, enum: [TEXT, IMAGES, BANNERS, FEED, PUBLISH, QA] }\n                status: { type: string, enum: [waiting, running, completed, blocked, failed, skipped] }\n                requested: { type: integer }\n                actual: { type: integer }\n                evidence: { type: string }\n      responses: { "200": { description: OK } }\n  /dev/jobs/{dev_job_id}/complete:\n    post:\n      operationId: completeDevJob\n      summary: Закрыть задачу; отклоняется, пока не пройдены все гейты\n      parameters:\n        - name: dev_job_id\n          in: path\n          required: true\n          schema: { type: string }\n      requestBody:\n        required: false\n        content:\n          application/json:\n            schema:\n              type: object\n              properties: { summary: { type: string } }\n      responses: { "200": { description: OK } }\n  /dev/jobs/{dev_job_id}/report:\n    get:\n      operationId: devReport\n      summary: Итоговый отчёт по задаче\n      parameters:\n        - name: dev_job_id\n          in: path\n          required: true\n          schema: { type: string }\n      responses: { "200": { description: OK } }\n  /a2a/orders:\n    post:\n      operationId: createA2AOrder\n      summary: Создать A2A order для существующей development-задачи\n      requestBody:\n        required: true\n        content:\n          application/json:\n            schema:\n              type: object\n              required: [dev_job_id, goal, acceptance_criteria]\n              properties:\n                dev_job_id: { type: string }\n                phase: { type: string }\n                goal: { type: string }\n                scope: { type: object }\n                acceptance_criteria: { type: array, items: { type: string } }\n                forbidden_changes: { type: array, items: { type: string } }\n                required_qa: { type: array, items: { type: string } }\n                required_evidence: { type: array, items: { type: string } }\n                assigned_to: { type: string, default: gpt-executor }\n                max_iterations: { type: integer }\n                priority: { type: integer }\n      responses: { "201": { description: OK } }\n  /a2a/orders/{order_id}:\n    get:\n      operationId: getA2AOrder\n      summary: Получить конкретный A2A order\n      parameters:\n        - name: order_id\n          in: path\n          required: true\n          schema: { type: integer }\n      responses: { "200": { description: OK } }\n  /a2a/orders/{order_id}/review-request:\n    post:\n      operationId: a2aReviewRequest\n      summary: Передать фактические evidence Executor на A2A review\n      parameters:\n        - name: order_id\n          in: path\n          required: true\n          schema: { type: integer }\n      requestBody:\n        required: true\n        content:\n          application/json:\n            schema:\n              type: object\n              required: [summary, evidence]\n              properties:\n                summary: { type: string }\n                evidence: { type: string }\n                files_changed: { type: array, items: { type: string } }\n                build: { type: string }\n                tests: { type: string }\n                runtime: { type: string }\n                acceptance_criteria: { type: array, items: { type: object } }\n                blockers: { type: array, items: { type: string } }\n                safety: { type: string }\n      responses: { "200": { description: OK } }\n  /a2a/orders/{order_id}/review:\n    post:\n      operationId: a2aReview\n      summary: A2A review: ACCEPT или RETURN_WITH_FIXES/BLOCKED по evidence\n      parameters:\n        - name: order_id\n          in: path\n          required: true\n          schema: { type: integer }\n      requestBody:\n        required: true\n        content:\n          application/json:\n            schema:\n              type: object\n              required: [verdict]\n              properties:\n                verdict: { type: string, enum: [ACCEPT, RETURN_WITH_FIXES, BLOCKED_HUMAN, BLOCKED_INFRA] }\n                note: { type: string }\n                fixes: { type: array, items: { type: object } }\n                blocked_reason: { type: string }\n      responses: { "200": { description: OK } }\n  /a2a/executor/orders/{order_id}/execute:\n    post:\n      operationId: executeA2AOrder\n      summary: Атомарно забрать и выполнить конкретный A2A order штатным Executor без сканирования очереди\n      parameters:\n        - name: order_id\n          in: path\n          required: true\n          schema: { type: integer }\n      responses: { "200": { description: OK } }\n  /handoffs:\n    post:\n      operationId: createHandoff\n      summary: Передать задачу другому агенту\n      requestBody:\n        required: true\n        content:\n          application/json:\n            schema:\n              type: object\n              required: [to]\n              properties:\n                to: { type: string }\n                kind: { type: string }\n                job_id: { type: string }\n                reason: { type: string }\n                context: { type: object }\n      responses: { "201": { description: OK } }\n  /commands:\n    post:\n      operationId: sendCommand\n      summary: Команда BORIS с обязательным idempotency_key\n      requestBody:\n        required: true\n        content:\n          application/json:\n            schema:\n              type: object\n              required: [operation, idempotency_key]\n              properties:\n                operation: { type: string }\n                account_id: { type: string }\n                params: { type: object }\n                idempotency_key: { type: string }\n                confirm: { type: boolean }\n                dry_run: { type: boolean }\n      responses: { "200": { description: OK } }\n  /clients/{account_id}/status:\n    get:\n      operationId: clientStatus\n      summary: Сводка по аккаунту клиента\n      parameters:\n        - name: account_id\n          in: path\n          required: true\n          schema: { type: string }\n      responses: { "200": { description: OK } }\n  /repo/tree:\n    post:\n      operationId: repoTree\n      summary: Дерево файлов проекта; секреты и бэкапы не отдаются\n      requestBody:\n        required: false\n        content:\n          application/json:\n            schema:\n              type: object\n              properties:\n                paths: { type: array, items: { type: string } }\n                max_entries: { type: integer }\n      responses: { "200": { description: OK } }\n  /repo/file:\n    get:\n      operationId: repoFile\n      summary: Прочитать файл проекта целиком или диапазоном строк\n      parameters:\n        - name: path\n          in: query\n          required: true\n          schema: { type: string }\n        - name: start\n          in: query\n          required: false\n          schema: { type: integer }\n        - name: end\n          in: query\n          required: false\n          schema: { type: integer }\n      responses: { "200": { description: OK } }\n  /repo/files:\n    post:\n      operationId: repoFiles\n      summary: Прочитать несколько файлов одним запросом\n      requestBody:\n        required: true\n        content:\n          application/json:\n            schema:\n              type: object\n              required: [paths]\n              properties:\n                paths: { type: array, items: { type: string } }\n      responses: { "200": { description: OK } }\n  /repo/patches:\n    post:\n      operationId: proposePatch\n      summary: Предложить правку кода; на диск ничего не пишется\n      requestBody:\n        required: true\n        content:\n          application/json:\n            schema:\n              type: object\n              required: [dev_job_id, edits]\n              properties:\n                dev_job_id: { type: string }\n                note: { type: string }\n                edits:\n                  type: array\n                  items:\n                    type: object\n                    required: [path]\n                    properties:\n                      path: { type: string }\n                      mode: { type: string, enum: [replace, full] }\n                      old: { type: string, description: "фрагмент из текущего файла, должен встречаться ровно один раз" }\n                      new: { type: string }\n                      content: { type: string, description: "для mode=full" }\n      responses: { "201": { description: OK } }\n    get:\n      operationId: listPatches\n      summary: Список предложенных правок\n      parameters:\n        - name: dev_job_id\n          in: query\n          required: false\n          schema: { type: string }\n        - name: status\n          in: query\n          required: false\n          schema: { type: string }\n      responses: { "200": { description: OK } }\n  /repo/patches/{patch_id}/autonomous-apply:\n    post:\n      operationId: autonomousApplyDevPatch\n      summary: Policy-enforced apply собственного development patch роли autonomous-dev\n      parameters:\n        - name: patch_id\n          in: path\n          required: true\n          schema: { type: integer }\n      responses: { "200": { description: OK } }\n  /repo/patches/{patch_id}:\n    get:\n      operationId: getPatch\n      summary: Одна правка со статусом и выводом проверки\n      parameters:\n        - name: patch_id\n          in: path\n          required: true\n          schema: { type: integer }\n      responses: { "200": { description: OK } }\n'
